### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Authorization Server Metadata (RFC 8414)
GET http://localhost:8080/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server

### Authorization endpoint - GET (RFC 6749 + PKCE RFC 7636)
GET http://localhost:8080/authorize?client_id=test&response_type=code&redirect_uri=http://localhost:9000/callback&code_challenge=test123&code_challenge_method=S256&state=xyz&scope=mcp

### Authorization confirm - POST (user approves)
# @no-redirect
POST http://localhost:8080/authorize
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=test&response_type=code&redirect_uri=http://localhost:9000/callback&code_challenge=test123&code_challenge_method=S256&state=xyz&scope=mcp